  ('no_reservations', 2, 5, 'Sweden', 'Stockholm', 'Stockholm', 'Sweden', 59.329323, 18.068581, 'Anthony Bourdain is off to investigate Sweden, ''a land of contrasts''. He is hoping to dispel the myths of tall blonds, Swedish meatballs, and ABBA.', '2006-04-24'),
