  ('no_reservations', 3, 4, 'Namibia', 'Walvis Bay', 'Walvis Bay', 'Namibia', -22.958408, 14.505751, 'In Namibia, Tony''s friend and guide, Garrett, introduces Tony to the fine art of sandboarding. German immigrant Hans takes Tony on a hunt for famous Namibian truffles and then for the poster-animal for Namibia.', '2007-01-22'),
