  ('no_reservations', 4, 11, 'Laos', 'Vientiane', 'Vientiane', 'Laos', 17.975706, 102.633104, 'Tony travels to Vientiane, Laos, where he meets a man who was a victim of an unexploded American bomb and takes part in a Baci ceremony.', '2008-07-07'),
  ('no_reservations', 4, 12, 'Colombia', 'Medellín', 'Medellín', 'Colombia', 6.244203, -75.581212, 'Tony visits the cities of Medellín and Cartagena in Colombia, and learns about its tragic past as a drug capital, as well as its more hopeful future.', '2008-07-14'),
  ('no_reservations', 4, 12, 'Colombia', 'Cartagena', 'Cartagena', 'Colombia', 10.391049, -75.479426, 'Tony visits the cities of Medellín and Cartagena in Colombia, and learns about its tragic past as a drug capital, as well as its more hopeful future.', '2008-07-14'),
  ('no_reservations', 4, 13, 'Saudi Arabia', 'Jeddah', 'Jeddah', 'Saudi Arabia', 21.485811, 39.192505, 'In a special episode of No Reservations, the show ran a FANatic contest, in which viewers were asked to submit a tape nominating their home town or country as a destination for a future episode of the show. The winner of the contest was Danya Alhamrani, and in this episode, Bourdain and crew visit her hometown of Jeddah, Saudi Arabia.', '2008-07-21'),
  ('no_reservations', 4, 14, 'Uruguay', 'Montevideo', 'Montevideo', 'Uruguay', -34.901113, -56.164531, 'Tony travels to Uruguay with his brother to research their roots after learning that they have family connections there. They enjoy chivitos, and other local specialties.', '2008-07-28'),
