  ('no_reservations', 6, 1, 'Panama', 'Panama City', 'Panama City', 'Panama', 8.982379, -79.51987, 'Tony visits Panama, including a trip to Manuel Noriega''s old house, and a trip into the rainforest, where he meets some local tribespeople. He also watches as the police set fire to a multi-million-dollar seized stash of cocaine.', '2010-01-11'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 2, 'Istanbul', 'Istanbul', 'Istanbul', 'Turkey', 41.008238, 28.978359, 'Tony visits Istanbul, Turkey, and samples lahmacun, doner kebab, islak burger, midye dolma, börek and rakı. He also visits the Blue Mosque.', '2010-01-18'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 3, 'Brittany', 'Brittany', 'Brittany', 'France', 48.202047, -2.932644, 'Tony travels to Brittany, France and enjoys some of the local specialties, like crepes, cider and oysters.', '2010-01-25'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 4, 'Prague', 'Prague', 'Prague', 'Czech Republic', 50.075538, 14.4378, 'Tony enjoys the old-world charms of Prague in the Czech Republic, and travels with local Michelin-awarded chef Zdenek Pohlreich.', '2010-02-01'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 5, 'Hudson Valley, NY', 'Hudson Valley', 'Hudson Valley', 'USA', 41.920902, -73.961289, 'Tony visits cities in Hudson Valley in New York State, accompanied at times by food writer Michael Ruhlman. He enjoys local crabs, visits his alma mater The Culinary Institute of America and Mohonk Mountain House, and has lunch with actor Bill Murray in Yonkers. He also meets his biggest challenge, the 10 year old daughter of Michael Pardus, Sierra.', '2010-02-08'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 6, 'Ecuador', 'Quito', 'Quito', 'Ecuador', -0.180653, -78.467838, 'Tony visits Ecuador''s Andean capital Quito to try some street food and local soups. He tries guinea pig in Sangolquí. Then he goes to the coast of Ecuador to try local seafood in Puerto López, Salango, Montañita, and Manglaralto. Finally he tries some local stews in Guayaquil and experiences a crab party.', '2010-03-01'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 6, 'Ecuador', 'Guayaquil', 'Guayaquil', 'Ecuador', -2.170998, -79.922359, 'Tony visits Ecuador''s Andean capital Quito to try some street food and local soups. He tries guinea pig in Sangolquí. Then he goes to the coast of Ecuador to try local seafood in Puerto López, Salango, Montañita, and Manglaralto. Finally he tries some local stews in Guayaquil and experiences a crab party.', '2010-03-01'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 7, 'Obsessed', 'New York City', 'New York City', 'USA', 40.7127753, -74.0059728, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 8, 'Harbin, China', 'Harbin', 'Harbin', 'China', 45.803775, 126.534967, 'Tony visits the city of Harbin in northeastern China and experiences the mix of Chinese and Russian cultures there. He also visits an eccentric local entrepreneur who enjoys karaoke and all things American.', '2010-03-15'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 9, 'Provence', 'Provence', 'Provence', 'France', 44.014494, 6.211644, 'Tony and crew stay at a villa in Provence, France, and Tony tries daube, aioli, terrine and Ricard Pastis, and plays pétanque. He then attempts to cook a provençal meal for some of the locals.', '2010-03-22'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 10, 'Vietnam: Central Highlands', 'Dalat', 'Dalat', 'Vietnam', 11.940419, 108.458313, 'Tony returns to Vietnam to explore the Central Highlands (Vietnam). His stops include the cities of Da Lat and Hanoi. Tony learns about the french history of region, and the former emperor Bảo Đại. Tony tries more woodland creatures like Java mouse-deer; eats a Hanoi delicacy: fried giant water bugs and water bugs extract; and teaches his friends the difference between wine and liquor.', '2010-03-29'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 10, 'Vietnam: Central Highlands', 'Hanoi', 'Hanoi', 'Vietnam', 21.027764, 105.83416, 'Tony returns to Vietnam to explore the Central Highlands (Vietnam). His stops include the cities of Da Lat and Hanoi. Tony learns about the french history of region, and the former emperor Bảo Đại. Tony tries more woodland creatures like Java mouse-deer; eats a Hanoi delicacy: fried giant water bugs and water bugs extract; and teaches his friends the difference between wine and liquor.', '2010-03-29'),
