  ('no_reservations', 6, 24, '100th Episode - Paris', 'Paris', 'Paris', 'France', 48.856614, 2.352222, 'For the 100th episode, Tony travels to Paris and meets with Éric Ripert and various local chefs, and they discuss the past and future of French cooking.', '2010-09-06'),
  ('no_reservations', 6, 25, 'Madrid', 'Madrid', 'Madrid', 'Spain', 40.416775, -3.70379, 'The chef visits Madrid during the 2010 football World Cup, and witnesses how Spain''s progress during the tournament brings the nation together. He also samples a Spanish omelette at tapas restaurant Bodega de la Ardosa.', '2010-09-13'),
