  ('no_reservations', 7, 3, 'Nicaragua', 'Managua', 'Managua', 'Nicaragua', 12.114993, -86.236174, 'Tony visits Nicaragua to sample the cuisine, and in the process discovers the determination necessary to live in modern-day Nicaragua.', '2011-03-14'),
