  ('no_reservations', 7, 13, 'US Desert', 'Pioneertown', 'Pioneertown', 'USA', 34.156442, -116.498645, 'Tony explores the Mojave Desert of southern California with Josh Homme of Queens of the Stone Age.', '2011-08-08'),
