  ('no_reservations', 7, 14, 'Ukraine', 'Crimea', 'Crimea', 'Ukraine', 44.952117, 34.102417, 'Tony and Zamir travel through the abandoned city of Chernobyl in Ukraine, site of a nuclear accident 25 years earlier. They then travel elsewhere in Ukraine including the Crimea and sample local food like green borscht.', '2011-08-15'),
