  ('no_reservations', 8, 1, 'Mozambique', 'Beira', 'Beira', 'Mozambique', -19.831595, 34.837018, 'Tony travels to Mozambique and finds himself in a mysterious, post-colonial Africa. From Portuguese ruins on Mozambique Island to the vibrant metropolis of Maputo, Mozambique doesn''t look like anywhere Tony has been so far.', '2012-04-09'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 1, 'Mozambique', 'Mozambique Island', 'Mozambique Island', 'Mozambique', -15.036449, 40.732331, 'Tony travels to Mozambique and finds himself in a mysterious, post-colonial Africa. From Portuguese ruins on Mozambique Island to the vibrant metropolis of Maputo, Mozambique doesn''t look like anywhere Tony has been so far.', '2012-04-09'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 1, 'Mozambique', 'Maputo', 'Maputo', 'Mozambique', -25.969248, 32.573175, 'Tony travels to Mozambique and finds himself in a mysterious, post-colonial Africa. From Portuguese ruins on Mozambique Island to the vibrant metropolis of Maputo, Mozambique doesn''t look like anywhere Tony has been so far.', '2012-04-09'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 2, 'Kansas City', 'Kansas City', 'Kansas City', 'USA', 39.099727, -94.578567, 'Tony travels to Kansas City, the BBQ capital of the world, with pal Zamir Gotta, in search of the best barbecue. While there, Tony meets up with musicians Dan and Patrick of The Black Keys for some serious finger licking meat. Zamir has his own adventures, visiting Leila''s Hair Museum and attending his first-ever tailgate party.', '2012-04-16'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 2, 'Kansas City', 'Kansas City', 'Kansas City', 'USA', 39.114053, -94.627464, 'Tony travels to Kansas City, the BBQ capital of the world, with pal Zamir Gotta, in search of the best barbecue. While there, Tony meets up with musicians Dan and Patrick of The Black Keys for some serious finger licking meat. Zamir has his own adventures, visiting Leila''s Hair Museum and attending his first-ever tailgate party.', '2012-04-16'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 3, 'Croatian Coast', 'Zadar', 'Zadar', 'Croatia', 44.119371, 15.231365, 'Tony visits the Croatian coast to swim with bluefin tuna and hunt for a prized white truffle. He literally gets knocked off his feet as he is treated to the finest Mediterranean cuisine.', '2012-04-23'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 3, 'Croatian Coast', 'Motovun', 'Motovun', 'Croatia', 45.335951, 13.827861, 'Tony visits the Croatian coast to swim with bluefin tuna and hunt for a prized white truffle. He literally gets knocked off his feet as he is treated to the finest Mediterranean cuisine.', '2012-04-23'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 3, 'Croatian Coast', 'Skradin', 'Skradin', 'Croatia', 43.817637, 15.923255, 'Tony visits the Croatian coast to swim with bluefin tuna and hunt for a prized white truffle. He literally gets knocked off his feet as he is treated to the finest Mediterranean cuisine.', '2012-04-23'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 4, 'Lisbon', 'Lisbon', 'Lisbon', 'Portugal', 38.722252, -9.139337, 'Once the center of the richest empire in Europe, Lisbon now faces one of the worst financial crises in the EU. But even as it struggles with rising debt and unemployment, Tony finds out that Lisbon is experiencing a cultural and culinary renaissance. Tony shares a meal and Fado performance with writer António Lobo Antunes. The music of Dead Combo is used throughout the episode and the band is featured in the episode as well, eating at a restaurant specialising in gourmet canned fish.', '2012-04-30'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 5, 'Japan: Cook It Raw', 'Tokyo', 'Tokyo', 'Japan', 35.689487, 139.691706, 'Tony heads to Japan for the gastronomic event that is Cook it Raw, which brings together some of the best chefs in the world to forage for local ingredients and serve the results to culinary experts.', '2012-05-07'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 5, 'Japan: Cook It Raw', 'Kaga, Ishikawa', 'Kaga', 'Japan', 36.302624, 136.314627, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 5, 'Japan: Cook It Raw', 'Kanazawa, Ishikawa', 'Kanazawa', 'Japan', 36.561325, 136.656205, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 5, 'Japan: Cook It Raw', 'Hakusan City, Ishikawa', 'Hakusan City', 'Japan', 36.514427, 136.565892, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 6, 'Finland', 'Helsinki', 'Helsinki', 'Finland', 60.169856, 24.938379, 'Heeding the calls of his Finnish Facebook fans, Tony takes a trip to Helsinki, Finland. He joins musician Sami Yaffa for a liquored-up tour of the world''s only pub tram, a bloody sauna and an unexpectedly exciting dinner with a cabbie''s mother.', '2012-05-14'),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 7, 'Baja', 'Ensenada, Baja California Norte', 'Ensenada', 'Mexico', 31.866743, -116.596371, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 7, 'Baja', 'Tijuana, Baja California Norte', 'Tijuana', 'Mexico', 32.514947, -117.038247, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 8, 8, 'Penang', 'Penang', 'Penang', 'Malaysia', 5.416393, 100.332679, 'Tony travels to Penang, Malaysia, where he experiences the local food including Asam Laksa and typical Nyonya dishes.', '2012-06-04'),
  ('no_reservations', 9, 1, 'Austin', 'Austin', 'Austin', 'USA', 30.267153, -97.743061, 'Tony visits Austin, Texas during the annual South by Southwest music festival and discovers that today''s indie rockers and hipsters are often foodies as well. He hangs out with the band Sleigh Bells for a seafood boil, and has Mexican food with Neon Indian and Alejandro Escovedo.', '2012-09-03'),
  ('no_reservations', 9, 2, 'Sydney', 'Sydney', 'Sydney', 'Australia', -33.86882, 151.209296, 'Tony travels to Sydney, Australia. Tony dives with sharks at Oceanworld Manly in Sydney, visits the sheep farms of the Blue Mountains and the chic innovative restaurants of the big city, samples fresh seafood, old school charcuterie, and the ubiquitous Australian barbie.', '2012-09-10'),
  ('no_reservations', 9, 3, 'Sex, Drugs And Rock & Roll', 'Phnom Penh', 'Phnom Penh', 'Cambodia', 11.5563738, 104.9282099, NULL, NULL),
  ('no_reservations', 9, 4, 'Emilia Romagna', 'Bologna', 'Bologna', 'Italy', 44.494887, 11.342616, 'Tony travels to the Emilia-Romagna region of Northern Italy with American expat chef Michael White. Tony races a Ferrari around the Autodromo Enzo e Dino Ferrari racing circuit in nearby Imola.', '2012-09-24'),
